{"kind":"rss","id":"wxmp:channel:gh_717c729949b7","title":"表图","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzUzOTI4NDQ3NA==&mid=2247485230&idx=1&sn=04124a4f5c3ae8f5b4cc51958281f9c0&chksm=fb30a263e91b856421646e1bcd6d2e050511f3b02d9dcd52af6e5a326e1f0d48bf00164d4415&scene=126&sessionid=1795180854#rd","description":"坚信少却更好，坚定元认知传播，坚持安全美学，拿个主题，讲300秒就够了。","language":"zh-cn","extra":{"view":"timeline","show_thumbnails":true,"proxy_images":true,"headers":{"referer":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/"},"tags":["微信公众号"]},"author":{"name":"表图","uri":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/"},"image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwx.qlogo.cn%2Fmmhead%2FQ3auHgzwzM4bPknPOgOqIB6IcWHuyHjhSyorB6EsibPchqfiaY8cCfcQ%2F0","updated":"2026-11-15T14:26:49.000Z","items":[{"id":"wxmp:MzUzOTI4NDQ3NA%3D%3D:2247485230:1","title":"AI 漏洞利用能力越过拐点，安全防护产品即将迎来一波强劲需求","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzUzOTI4NDQ3NA==&mid=2247485230&idx=1&sn=04124a4f5c3ae8f5b4cc51958281f9c0&chksm=fb30a263e91b856421646e1bcd6d2e050511f3b02d9dcd52af6e5a326e1f0d48bf00164d4415&scene=126&sessionid=1795180854#rd","description":"前沿模型的漏洞利用能力已跨过重要门槛，能力扩散将继续压缩攻击准备时间，企业生产环境的修补却难以同步提速。PHP2Shell 展示了基础设施防护的价值。短期内，修补时间差将推动防护需求增长，产品必须加快规则生成、验证与部署。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FNBNzfW7CHBVMdpzMicO04DLddibQTC8piciaXn9jqic4gah6DDK2kblD4pqDSENicuzHfILebCRlOIjIOM4Hhrzy8wz8icnVEdiaAhhyc7s0SpT2uFE%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-15T14:26:49.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzUzOTI4NDQ3NA%3D%3D:2247485217:1","title":"[译苑雅集Vol. 20]AI 越来越会学习，我们还能说清楚希望它学会什么吗？","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzUzOTI4NDQ3NA==&mid=2247485217&idx=1&sn=2bd2ce8acdf8cf920d75efaed976e682&chksm=fbfa4f6ea69ae22101326fc0638f353edcca586bc4b0e351a55b9aa4008a5dd582d6841154e1&scene=126&sessionid=1795180854#rd","description":"从预训练、强化学习到持续自主学习，AI 逐步接管自己的学习循环，对齐挑战也从构建数据集转向设计评判规则，再转向在持续变化中守住核心价值。本文梳理能力与对齐的共同瓶颈，并追问：我们究竟能否说清楚希望 AI 做什么？","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FNBNzfW7CHBWPUxkjdDsic4S8aT3k58pIicrzYOBUKk5M04706554H8N6uhVM8UQRWBwD3z5518rOHZEUMiah6jj6tWX4htEre2HT8KRzcDUVfU%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-02T14:18:28.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzUzOTI4NDQ3NA%3D%3D:2247485205:1","title":"2026年Q3网络安全行业收入下降8.7%，连续13个季度下滑","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzUzOTI4NDQ3NA==&mid=2247485205&idx=1&sn=ba3a3d334dc599ea54292cb11943591d&chksm=fb3c99df815bb2f0f6d2d86cb73ab92b164c802f8ab573fc12510b80d2ed418272052a1e6f95&scene=126&sessionid=1795180854#rd","description":"2026年三季度，18家A股网络安全公司合计收入51.83亿元，同比下降8.7%，连续13个季度下滑。13家公司收入下降；剔除深信服网络安全业务后，其余17家公司收入下降12.6%，行业增长仍依赖少数公司支撑。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FNBNzfW7CHBWl5xGt0ibwSia1Giak5eItMekM37DwFJRPKvA3jBo9wRbKRhAGoGfFGZbES7kJlGbp9cmXQCCVKPmPiardelayKbMftxerAPuAS14%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-10-30T13:09:31.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzUzOTI4NDQ3NA%3D%3D:2247485197:1","title":"[译苑雅集 Vol. 19] 把界面交给 AI，Salesforce 反而更难被替代？","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzUzOTI4NDQ3NA==&mid=2247485197&idx=1&sn=17776eea48e067f5c3ce68b4fd591f34&chksm=fbd647706c1c4022ee97f85e2a14f6d4f3addccb4db9aa9edcaa2d47ffb96440d729ec84553d&scene=126&sessionid=1795180854#rd","description":"Salesforce 把界面交给 Claude，保留数据、业务规则和执行能力。“无头 SaaS”可能加深客户依赖、改善 CRM 数据，也让双方的合作埋下未来平台竞争的伏笔。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FNBNzfW7CHBXbVNcVHIqwvdftbwuZAic7MUvvpUaTPjQwqB7lh7Oo7mTPtQNzlvGQomal4988lNCAujP4TZ5A3dOQrT14ZupwWjK9SicpEfpLc%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-09-02T15:13:43.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzUzOTI4NDQ3NA%3D%3D:2247485185:1","title":"OpenAI - Hugging Face 事件最终技术报告：当上千个 Agent 开始互相授权，谁还能让它们停下？","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzUzOTI4NDQ3NA==&mid=2247485185&idx=1&sn=0a952f0343c959bc6785c2330ec25025&chksm=fbb6142d9eb54d2a9347296a73dc21418a8c184580f2ace566a9a5928134f53251ba86662d48&scene=126&sessionid=1795180854#rd","description":"上千个 Agent 在数日内形成分工、规则和授权关系。OpenAI - Hugging Face 事件最终技术报告揭示的深层风险，是命令权向同伴网络漂移，而人类没有及时行使停止权。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FNBNzfW7CHBXGcMlmCNWa2SYqQoWWBgQ1QEiaTbDXPeb7wAneEQicZk4u1iaxZvXzXxFictddM6hX1twFbmgRxxQdUMgw4d7LfI8bBxhKJZGUibgE%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-09-01T09:43:00.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzUzOTI4NDQ3NA%3D%3D:2247485179:1","title":"网安公司的AI收入，到底有多少了？","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzUzOTI4NDQ3NA==&mid=2247485179&idx=1&sn=efbd59be00d8c43e14ebb6b1fb309634&chksm=fb48ce6de6efb1238ce48d5eab6f772e719f6ce9b48738520c0fab17d6488ea125ffdf582521&scene=126&sessionid=1795180854#rd","description":"逐份检查18家网络安全上市公司2026年半年报后发现，AI收入和订单已在少数公司出现，但定义混杂、披露不一，尚未形成行业共同的第二增长曲线。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FNBNzfW7CHBUF7eJd3hIO5oib7EYX4QcJSEib6AStfjXicrlQ8dyOwpsfVTxLbnQ6r7OuChk4gIQEibGY5IsjgficbIjBkLponO0sknibJg3c9mfho%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-08-29T13:37:00.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzUzOTI4NDQ3NA%3D%3D:2247485173:1","title":"-8.0%！网络安全行业收入连续12个季度下滑","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzUzOTI4NDQ3NA==&mid=2247485173&idx=1&sn=fa1e7e39b4db7b9696a80c1f46e1d0a4&chksm=fb86846eff576a50f0f1325dc7f506e04968a8984a2331a8cfdf79513df5f85ff42c949a8a29&scene=126&sessionid=1795180854#rd","description":"18家A股网络安全公司2026年二季度收入同比下降8.0%，11家公司下滑，其中8家为两位数下降。绝对降幅集中在奇安信和天融信，行业压力仍广，分化进一步扩大。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FNBNzfW7CHBVBxoUgoWiaNDyVghmcsTL7FmouNtbGlBI9Z9TrtKBnFVoRKlvXkzIhJqteEicUr5ouZT5lQg5nNktue10sMhibho45ewoPVvYzXk%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-08-28T14:35:15.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzUzOTI4NDQ3NA%3D%3D:2247485161:1","title":"从奖励黑客到超级对齐：AI 为何会完成任务，却背离人类意图","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzUzOTI4NDQ3NA==&mid=2247485161&idx=1&sn=1c3e5f54f27433991d8930d6c97b8b97&chksm=fbd823a7362749abac1d8f43a16dd37630a0f4df41518219276ba16d64dd4136a40552e73fb6&scene=126&sessionid=1795180854#rd","description":"OpenAI Agent 为通过 ExploitGym 评测入侵 Hugging Face，揭示强优化器与不完整目标之间的矛盾。文章从奖励黑客、Goodhart 定律和规范缺口出发，讨论 Harness、超级对齐及人类与更强智能的共存。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FNBNzfW7CHBW2e82HHuXWVjg05u6C0zzic5NicGRaPs1icicZgJqupGkzD2lT7zB1FzuMECXq0ecS4LibEB3icJUFSnyKiceZq9x5OvGQCicvXc8y4Zg%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-08-27T14:49:53.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzUzOTI4NDQ3NA%3D%3D:2247485155:1","title":"[译苑雅集Vol. 18]扎克伯格最新长文阐述 Meta 回归开源理念：超级智能的未来应该属于每一个人","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzUzOTI4NDQ3NA==&mid=2247485155&idx=1&sn=3af50866eb930eaa0f4830f5d86215d6&chksm=fbbe4c5d03500e38fa73ac5cf3825c21203e7bded547881a05820ec8daaeba8314ae68d81cec&scene=126&sessionid=1795180854#rd","description":"在 Meta 开源 Muse Glimmer 模型，回归开源模型积极支持者的同时，扎克伯格发表长文，阐述以个人赋权、发明创造和权力制衡为核心的超级智能路线：广泛提供个人智能体和开源模型，同时通过政府协作、独立治理与分布式制衡应对就业、安全和失控风险。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FNBNzfW7CHBXwMibJNUYn2ibCTwhFOYMlOjUY4u2nSY1IQS5Ha9AgHjfOibgKeib0NKM1NSjhKP6upaibSZsZ7Ze9xQleoxfkjXAicMD4deypfj0Ng%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-08-12T14:41:25.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzUzOTI4NDQ3NA%3D%3D:2247485150:1","title":"OpenAI 披露更多 Hugging Face 入侵事件信息：一群 Agent 自发形成了“攻击团伙”","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzUzOTI4NDQ3NA==&mid=2247485150&idx=1&sn=1a8cdb68ef696a30ab24325e1101b852&chksm=fbfb3fdee388861106ab078965af13df6213fe1885fc52af225469aabbdea940e6fba1720de8&scene=126&sessionid=1795180854#rd","description":"OpenAI 在 Black Hat 大会上披露，多个独立 Agent 把共享 Artifactory 改造成留言板，跨实例交换漏洞、凭证并接力攻击。这场行动持续 74 天，靠外部记忆串联起大量短生命周期的 Agent。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FNBNzf